{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Tyr, a tank shooter where positioning, strategic decision-making, and mastery of unique abilities win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TANKS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Pilot Heavy Armor - Tyr features a roster of tanks with unique armor profiles\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.webm?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr features a roster of specialized armored vehicles and pilots. You\u2019ll take control of treaded and hover tanks alike as you angle &amp; position for defense, and rumble and glide across the battlefield.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Upgrade And Customize Your Vehicle - Each vehicle in Tyr boasts its own unique tech tree, complete with a Keystone tech that can change up how you engage in combat\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.webm?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle also offers its own tech tree and ammo &amp; component slots, affording you the ability to upgrade and evolve your ride to suit your playstyle. You may even be able to change up your vehicle\u2019s unique keystone tech to dynamically alter your personal meta.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Wield Unique Abilities - Tanks using special abilities like a force bubble that pushes enemies, a blink that teleports the tank ahead a few vehicle lengths, and sonar that reveals enemy positions to the pilot\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.webm?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/49593c7fa74586bdb81b62271facd2d3.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle features a unique power that impacts Tyr\u2019s moment-to-moment play on the battlefield. A tank may have the ability to blink several vehicle lengths forward or back, send out a sonar pulse to spot enemies, or overcharge its engine to ram directly into an opponent and deal massive damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASYMMETRIC VISION</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Play For Vision - Tyr&#039;s asymmetric vision system means that the enemy can see you while you won&#039;t necessarily see them, and once you&#039;re spotted the whole enemy team knows your position. Return to cover!\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.webm?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/d40a8e7b01fd6deaeeefdbf8a064b7ae.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Tyr, you and your opponents will only be visible when within range or while making enough noise. Deciding when to push forward and when to fire from cover could mean the difference between staying hidden and revealing your position to the entire enemy team, so play carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGY</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Strategy Beats Twitch Reflexes - Tanks cresting a hill and destroying a poorly position opponent\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.webm?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr will test your mental mettle, patience, and teamwork, as deliberate play beats whoever can fire the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer tank shooter\u00a0</strong>- Engage in strategic team battles with heavy-armored vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A roster of heavy armor</strong>\u00a0- Tanks in Tyr each feature a unique armor profile that you can angle and position to deflect enemy shots in the heat of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle customization</strong> - Individual tech trees, ammo slots, and component upgrades for each tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keystone tech variations</strong> - Max level your tank to unlock meta-changing tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric vision\u00a0</strong>- Position yourself correctly, and you\u2019ll see the enemy and spot them for your team, while the enemy can't see you in return</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique vehicle abilities</strong>- Each tank has a distinct ability  that makes moment-to-moment play more high-stakes and interesting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy beats twitch reflexes\u00a0</strong>- Run and gun gameplay gets punished by careful positioning and slow, deliberately placed shots to disable enemies</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2445260?t=1772562893","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/30d0bf04fb32f83efd9ec4025eed9ebbf2d7654d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772562893","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/4bd51a19beb3bdde0c4900439eb4d64e547e9579/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772562893","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/4bd51a19beb3bdde0c4900439eb4d64e547e9579/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1772562893","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Private Playtest</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/2b8e177ae30af8e475e213c70c305fa1.avif?t=1772562893\" width=780 height=240 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Tyr, a tank shooter where positioning, strategic decision-making, and mastery of unique abilities win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TANKS</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Pilot Heavy Armor - Tyr features a roster of tanks with unique armor profiles\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.webm?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/4b651aaa81e95f1473dea1bbb7dd4c49.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr features a roster of specialized armored vehicles and pilots. You\u2019ll take control of treaded and hover tanks alike as you angle &amp; position for defense, and rumble and glide across the battlefield.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CUSTOMIZATION</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/be5cb021e4cd073e40d0efe3d10f709e.poster.avif?t=1772562893\" aria-label=\"Upgrade And Customize Your Vehicle - Each vehi