 src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/extras/7d8027d56b61a9899128dfe9dd2a70f7.mp4?t=1772562893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tyr will test your mental mettle, patience, and teamwork, as deliberate play beats whoever can fire the fastest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer tank shooter\u00a0</strong>- Engage in strategic team battles with heavy-armored vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A roster of heavy armor</strong>\u00a0- Tanks in Tyr each feature a unique armor profile that you can angle and position to deflect enemy shots in the heat of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vehicle customization</strong> - Individual tech trees, ammo slots, and component upgrades for each tank</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keystone tech variations</strong> - Max level your tank to unlock meta-changing tech</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Asymmetric vision\u00a0</strong>- Position yourself correctly, and you\u2019ll see the enemy and spot them for your team, while the enemy can't see you in return</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique vehicle abilities</strong>- Each tank has a distinct ability  that makes moment-to-moment play more high-stakes and interesting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy beats twitch reflexes\u00a0</strong>- Run and gun gameplay gets punished by careful positioning and slow, deliberately placed shots to disable enemies</p></li></ul>","developers":["Stoke Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2445260/604e8794175ccacd71c5cce09d276f8819044bf1/header_alt_assets_0.jpg